{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_09b5fddd434153c0becee974b4945ee1ea9e124eb6fb9f96e71f05f38c1efbb5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d7bf22aae04c75ba7efd4180a80a7b954a2027b0eb71161895140a4b9365c2f","slc_40be90fe9b58e77706794e1c276921ced9e23e120f94043359ca580422d2bc34","slc_b22fc9da98da510c5d12ee84b9bc8b5b9d6553b1a912d87ace6dccbbafd4f6f2"],"source_ids":["src_140adfe1143e551ab910113e52e41a7e"],"text":"Repository development practice: PRs must be focused on one logical change, include tests for behavior changes, update docs when user-facing behavior changes, pass all CI checks, and every contributor must sign the Alibaba CLA before merge.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_32ef382ea12467e64979669c4b49e9d3923e03704b47ddfd7f2c12e82ad608c3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_328dc6ceea415e32211110fcc5d95136d1a02b925733c7e838bdc3aa623116ec"],"source_ids":["src_57bd6ea6268855678328178e8da46cb9"],"text":"Related files are grouped into bundles, and each bundle runs as a sub-agent with isolated context, described as a divide-and-conquer strategy that stays stable on large changesets and supports concurrent review.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4db274464bd36c34f3faa27a3f21083ae8508ada708359789f4c62244b442338","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_00254d06fb3318b079244f65cdbe1eec463c4e0e1e1b8905b06c2d63719c21ac","slc_04dc0e22ae1797599888da1ced4207aa67028abfb7545fa8bd26b897383b8f78","slc_34a4a415093f86b0c7e83a6a9a40282e8bc1fe1ece14d69fe42055794e13da7f","slc_7c7aeb8278e39e73cab7ee18ba45796537fb90c411f9a3d517af966caa8196bb","slc_a694c47dac900654e7f26ba4460856a4c5682b344fc75ba90ff342369b3f1eb8","slc_af4de10de9173ae38a5f751088d72f9c68fb29dfe5eff230bed9f766e95f0d05","slc_f67c153342d211aa4011530dce6867190c45f3c6d582389a45c0a63c8864c821"],"source_ids":["src_57bd6ea6268855678328178e8da46cb9"],"text":"The product exposes an `ocr` CLI with commands including `ocr review` (workspace, --from/--to branch range, --commit), `ocr scan`, `ocr config provider/model`, `ocr session list`, and `ocr delegate`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_55f2c41ecca2f0651e336554e0448c4c81c5ba78cb74a1b39f80aa6dae785844","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0a172b7105c36e40ebebe107a6e4704cbf88a288fff3cbeb49b0459de0e58f3e","slc_27c64a351170dee4ce9a5965e040681c439c987522d00e28cb58f614bebbadc8","slc_488610d82cd44a082e4a35f05a63a688317466fc4ccb264798b4e1cfcc376e96","slc_cea1c78e663616edd2039b3ad7900666476505ceb1fea45f67ac8ef77945cbf9"],"source_ids":["src_e74ef1e59e925fa4bc60464136f4f943"],"text":"The product optionally serves a local web viewer for browsing review session history; the viewer binds to localhost by default and uses a host-header allowlist (configurable via OCR_VIEWER_ALLOWED_HOSTS) to block DNS rebinding.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_56229336c50ba397bb242254f2fbe4cefda45d8c863c4e2a8ec1d030e049f5d9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_27c64a351170dee4ce9a5965e040681c439c987522d00e28cb58f614bebbadc8","slc_cea1c78e663616edd2039b3ad7900666476505ceb1fea45f67ac8ef77945cbf9"],"source_ids":["src_e74ef1e59e925fa4bc60464136f4f943"],"text":"Security defaults follow fail-safe principles: API keys come only from environment variables and are never logged or written to output files, and LLM responses undergo JSON schema validation with line-number bounds checking.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5e672a90824e6b18afaa8845da6b8d906e4dd2b188dcfc290d2475f8c1794579","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_27c64a351170dee4ce9a5965e040681c439c987522d00e28cb58f614bebbadc8","slc_cea1c78e663616edd2039b3ad7900666476505ceb1fea45f67ac8ef77945cbf9","slc_e7e56b131f2fc61044a0c1fd537d4a434dbaebb83a0c6c57dcbda3197489b512"],"source_ids":["src_e74ef1e59e925fa4bc60464136f4f943"],"text":"Per the assurance case, agent file paths are validated against the repository root before and after symlink resolution, and external process execution is limited to git with hardcoded subcommands, plus a few user-configured call sites.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_69566f5e26c42329412adf5da2bee2455861ae1a111f0c3a1c3789802db73670","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_eec63c3b018098315414fbd0cc8fe042dd47aedf222b567d2d43de0b8d14a019"],"source_ids":["src_57bd6ea6268855678328178e8da46cb9"],"text":"The README acknowledges lower recall than general-purpose agents, framed as a deliberate trade-off favoring precision over noise.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7911bd8adf73c81b8e0a95864815a9047316ecf757607bcfe0ab936e4fb17937","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_092343126f1cfdffbb95817d5f9925159a2cca4c4cfab1a9ef30b059df50c4a4","slc_328dc6ceea415e32211110fcc5d95136d1a02b925733c7e838bdc3aa623116ec","slc_e6e68d71cb34d6233a6dfdb3d72f4bbb565770778e80eaea00238ff715742dce","slc_ea2047db6666bfc8e2a42cfec90901a3e343971885b4d6aba93baa915fe98d65"],"source_ids":["src_57bd6ea6268855678328178e8da46cb9"],"text":"The core design pairs deterministic engineering (file selection, file bundling, template-based rule matching, positioning/reflection modules) with an agent for dynamic decisions and context retrieval.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","created_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_907db88c7eb34dcb1278b0d9d49cd32cc541aac3cc2424fbae1dbda54ada8a86","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"alibaba/open-code-review@494bf1c8d7a1 snapshot 5996e384ce40ea12","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_569d1e32bfc34b3f3613980c1876fb2cd3d96a1ac99bb08011fba71bafdbc846","slc_95912a340c1e0b87259227981cdf2b2308ab1291f2648c8669a25e21035c518e","slc_eec63c3b018098315414fbd0cc8fe042dd47aedf222b567d2d43de0b8d14a019"],"source_ids":["src_57bd6ea6268855678328178e8da46cb9"],"text":"The README reports a benchmark built from 50 open-source repositories, 200 real PRs, and 10 languages with 1,505 annotated issues, measuring F1, precision, recall, average time, and tokens; it claims higher precision/F1 than Claude Code at ~1/9 the tokens but lower recall by design.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:22Z","updated_by_operation":"op_0081817751834b5f998fcd1366fda1f7"}
